  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado /GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\n2020-2026 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab (Excl. 2019 1500 LD)\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR running boards are compatible with 2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado /GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab, 2020-2026 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab (Excl. 2019 1500 LD), ensuring seamless integration and enhanced style\nDurable & Dependable: Made with stainless steel that outperforms ordinary steel in rust resistance and durability, these side steps support up to 450 lbs per side; Combined with tough ABS step pads, they provide lasting reliability for passengers, pets, and heavy gear\nAll-Weather Traction: 6-inch wide nerf bars with trapezoidal ABS stepping surface ensure non-slip footing in rain, snow, or mud, making every entry and exit stable and secure\nEasy to Install: Bottom slider design allows forward or backward adjustment for better customization; Easily bolt on the step bars to your vehicle with no cutting or drilling needed\nTough & Stylish Protection: Step rails guard your vehicle's lower body from dings and scratches, while guarded ends prevent bumping knees and enhance the sleek, rugged look of your truck\nProfessional installation recommended",
